        "id": 1944405
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-31T18:44:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think adding `CpuTopology` and then a separate top level flag for `cpu_count` may complicate the logic, or just be confusing. My initial implementation also would have been confusing as it would allow both `match_host` and `cpu_count` to be set.\n\nInstead I added `cpu_count` as an option to `cpu_topology`",
      "parentUuid": "d1bd4d37_44d3504b",
